text: ['First strike\\nNoncreature spells cost {1} more to cast.', "Haste\\nWhenever you cast a spell, if it's the second creature spell you cast this turn, you may return Vengevine from your graveyard to the battlefield.", "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nWhenever Geist of Saint Traft attacks, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying that's tapped and attacking. Exile that token at end of combat.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nDestroy target nonland permanent with mana value 3 or less.", "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}: Inkmoth Nexus becomes a 1/1 Phyrexian Blinkmoth artifact creature with flying and infect until end of turn. It's still a land. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters and to players in the form of poison counters.)"]
flavor: ['"Thraben is our home and I will not see it fall to this unhallowed horde."', 'Leave but a shred of root and it will return, bursting with vigor.', "The worst part isn't the pain, or the smell, or even the fear of death. It's hearing the clatter of bone on stone and knowing the bones are yours."]
